,["نَجْعَلَ","V","stem","IMPF|1P|MOOD:SUBJ"],["هُمُ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"28:5:12","a":"ٱلْوَٰرِثِينَ","t":"the inheritors","p":"N","tr":"l-wārithīna","f":["ACT","PCPL","MP","ACC"],"r":267,"l":1111,"g":[["ٱلْ","DET","prefix","Al"],["ْوَٰرِ","N","stem","ACT|PCPL|MP|ACC"]]},{"e":"٥","v":"28:5"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"27:89","t":"Whoever comes [at Judgement] with a good deed will have better than it, and they, from the terror of that Day, will be safe.","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":89,"sd":null},{"k":"27:90","t":"And whoever comes with an evil deed - their faces will be overturned into the Fire, [and it will be said], \"Are you recompensed except for what you used to do?\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":90,"sd":null},{"k":"27:91","t":"[Say, O Muḥammad], \"I have only been commanded to worship the Lord of this city, who made it sacred and to whom [belongs] all things. And I am commanded to be of the Muslims [i.e., those who submit to Allāh].","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":91,"sd":null},{"k":"27:92","t":"And to recite the Qur’ān.\" And whoever is guided is only guided for [the benefit of] himself; and whoever strays - say, \"I am only [one] of the warners.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":92,"sd":null},{"k":"27:93","t":"And say, \"[All] praise is [due] to Allāh. He will show you His signs, and you will recognize them. And your Lord is not unaware of what you do.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":93,"sd":null},{"k":"28:1","t":"Ṭā, Seen, Meem.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"28:2","t":"These are verses of the clear Book.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"28:3","t":"We recite to you from the news of Moses and Pharaoh in truth for a people who believe.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"28:4","t":"Indeed, Pharaoh exalted himself in the land and made its people into factions, oppressing a sector among them, slaughtering their [newborn] sons and keeping their females alive. Indeed, he was of the corrupters.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"28:5","t":"And We wanted to confer favor upon those who were oppressed in the land and make them leaders and make them inheritors","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":5,"sd":null}],"juz":20,"hizb":39,"surahs":[27,28],"sajdah":false}